   403	Counsel memo WP-8935 advises retaining full treasury wire cutoff failures threads because litigation hold scope may extend beyond the transactions named in formal notices.
   404	
   405	Working paper WP-5928 documents a three-way match failure on treasury wire cutoff failures where accrual true-ups near $31,981 never received matching compliance responses during February recon.
   406	
   407	Draft sidebar (non-authoritative): some prototype tooling compared compliance mail timestamps against post-correction effective dates when flagging holds. Brief 09 later in this archive supersedes that draft practice for production reconciliation.
   408	
   409	Risk assessment WP-3912 links treasury wire cutoff failures to control gaps in mail ingestion for treasury. The assessment explicitly warns against treating alternate ledger headings or appendix commentary as transaction sources.
   410	
